perational services, such as NetApp Data Infrastructure Insights and Instaclustr; and professional and support services include storage-as-a-service (STaaS), strategic consulting, professional, managed, and support services, as well as assessment, design, implementation, migration, and proactive support services to optimize the performance and efficiency of their on-premises and hybrid multicloud storage environments. Further, it offers ransomware protection, data backup and recovery, and disaster recovery. It serves various industries comprising energy, financial services, government, technology, internet, life sciences, healthcare services, manufacturing, media, entertainment, animation, video postproduction, and telecommunications through a direct sales force and an ecosystem of partners, including the cloud providers. The company has a strategic alliance with Commvault Systems, Inc. to develop an integrated solution for enterprise data protection and cyber resilience; and Super Micro Computer, Inc. to build integrated AI infrastructure solutions. NetApp, Inc. was incorporated in 1992 and is based in San Jose, California.","employees":11700,"website":"https://www.netapp.com","country":"United States","city":"San Jose","officers":[{"name":"Mr. George  Kurian","title":"CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Cesar Cernuda Rego","title":"President"},{"name":"Mr. Wissam G. Jabre C.F.A.","title":"Executive VP & CFO"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.48,"tpe":30.05,"ps":4.43,"pfcf":25.99,"peg":1.11,"pb":4.647,"ev_ebitda":18.95,"rev_growth":0.191,"eps_growth":0.356,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2432,"eps_growth_next":0.1809,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1241,"roa":0.04945,"de":32.8,"gross_margin":0.5312,"op_margin":0.1174,"profit_margin":0.09364,"current_ratio":1.863},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":16.77,"sector":17.48,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":26.43,"sector":30.05,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":4.981,"sector":4.43,"